{
  "version": "2.0.0-datalake",
  "description": "Lakehouse/medallion generation, multi-turn chat, G11-safe refinement and validation cases. Refinement seeds use the connector ids the isolated eval harness seeds for fixtures.connectors (00000000-0000-4000-8000-<index+1>); remap them for a live tenant. Catalog configKeys are derived from codedAIFields.",
